The minions are small, yellow creatures who have existed since the beginning of time
they are always searching for the biggest and most evil masters to serve.
kevin,stuart and bob went on an adventure to find a new leaders for the minions.
their journey takes them to new york and london, where they meet scarlet overkill,
a supervillain who wants to become the queen of england.
after many funny and exciting events, the minions prove their loyaltyband eventually
begin working with gru, who becomes their new master.
